WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.387
Why Oracle Cloud?

2
00:00:01.387 --> 00:00:04.187
Because the estate isn't only Microsoft.

3
00:00:04.187 --> 00:00:08.129
Where an agency's HR platform runs
on Oracle Cloud Infrastructure,

4
00:00:08.129 --> 00:00:12.500
a maintenance window on that platform
reaches the people who depend on it,

5
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.151
whether or not anyone
read the announcement.

6
00:00:15.151 --> 00:00:16.800
So the goal is concrete.

7
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:21.254
By the end of this chapter you can
read every announcement for a tenancy,

8
00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:24.576
the latest in each chain,
with its affected resources,

9
00:00:24.576 --> 00:00:28.200
into records that carry Oracle's
own action-required date.

10
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:31.326
Then the HR platform's
maintenance goes to the

11
00:00:31.326 --> 00:00:34.340
HR system's owners before
it lands, not after.
